From: MoltBrowser <noreply@geneye.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] Add portable math

The decoder computes dequantization weights, transfer functions, XYB
biases and splines with the standard library's powf, exp, ln, log2,
cbrt and hypot, the platform's C library, whose results differ between
operating systems and, with glibc, CPUs. moltbrowser_math routes them
through one switch: the standard library's by default, the libm
crate's after moltbrowser_set_portable(true), which also turns on
jxl_simd's scalar mode. Chromium's wrapper (jxl_rs) exposes it to
JXLImageDecoder. jxl depends on libm for it.
---
